TITLE:: RCRhythmDict
summary:: Per-batch rhythm definitions resolved against a subseq library
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCSubseqLibrary, Classes/RCSubseq, Classes/RCPathControl

DESCRIPTION::
code::at(batchName)[key]:: holds rhythm-dict entries code::[priority, shiftAdd, "lib.path.name", mask?, params?, keysIgnoreOrder?, unused, timeMult?]::; link::#-subseqs:: resolves them into link::Classes/RCSubseq::s with the library shift and durations scaled by timeMult, params expanded per hit and the mask expanded per hit. Unlike the proto-library, the library entries are never mutated and their keysIgnoreOrder is honoured.

